{"version":1,"content":"<p>名導演王晶與葉念琛聯手監製、執導的喜劇電影《麻雀女王追男仔》，由高海寧、馬國明、陳家樂與陳靜主演。</p><p>該片去年初在香港上映時累積約380萬港元票房，不料近日改名為《麻將女王》進軍內地院線，成績卻跌破眾人眼鏡—，上映8天累計票房僅約4,455元人</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:19:19.764791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:10:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.056743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.056743+00:00","content_hash":"b52af792c30fb37f011bdda4262b9327896927d07e400ff6ce79d0d4c8df5f1d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}